{"availability":"available","full":"Nystik-gh/ignis","name":"ignis","description":"Run Obsidian as a self-hosted web app. Not remote desktop, an actual web app.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1471,"forks":84,"created":"2026-03-08T14:03:03Z","updated":"2026-10-01T21:14:34Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","stars":1471,"forks":84}],"technologies":["Node.js","Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ignis is a compatibility shim that provides browser-compatible implementations of the Electron APIs used by Obsidian, allowing Obsidian to run in a standard browser while keeping your vault on the server. Obsidian is not included in or distributed with this project. The Docker container downloads Obsidian directly from its official source on first run.","While Obsidian's local-first approach works well for most users, options for accessing your own Obsidian installation remotely have been limited to VNC-based solutions with poor user experience. Ignis provides an alternative for users who want to access their own copy of Obsidian from a browser, in a close-to-native format."],"features":["Core Obsidian: editor, canvas, bases, command palette, context menus, themes, and CSS snippets.","Most community plugins built on Obsidian's plugin API. Plugins needing Node native modules or childprocess do not load.","File upload (ribbon, right-click, drag-and-drop) and download (files, or folders as ZIP).","Multi-vault support with create, open, switch, rename, and delete, and a different vault per browser tab.","Live sync between tabs over WebSocket, so edits propagate within a second."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nystik-gh/ignis/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"32ceabed9fff1a71fc3b9a314fcb9e195107b30454f65ae1ba451befdbc4aca4","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Ignis is a compatibility shim that provides browser-compatible implementations of the Electron APIs used by Obsidian, allowing Obsidian to run in a standard browser while keeping your vault on the server. Obsidian is not included in or distributed with this project. The Docker container downloads Obsidian directly from its official source on first run.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nystik-gh/ignis/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"32ceabed9fff1a71fc3b9a314fcb9e195107b30454f65ae1ba451befdbc4aca4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nystik-gh/ignis/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T21:14:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nystik-gh/ignis/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","hash":"32ceabed9fff1a71fc3b9a314fcb9e195107b30454f65ae1ba451befdbc4aca4","originalBytes":6728,"storedBytes":6728,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["obsidian","ignis","vault","plugin","see","file","browser","project","run","docker","open","source","vaults","access","cache","compatibility","directly","documentation","dynalist","features","first","full","inc.","license","obsidian-app","official","plugins","server","sync","under","url","write","app","apps","architecture.md","authentication","browser.","compose","container","content","context","contributing.md","copy","create","daily","data","desktop","directive","distributed","downloads","electron","ignis-server","included","interoperability","large","legal.md","limitations","limited","list","live","most","node","note","opened","over","own","provides","remote","settings","setup","setup.","shim","slow","start","tab","tabs","their","tree","user","use